.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-overdue 1  "overdue " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-overdue \- List open tasks whose due date has passed, or move them all with \-\-reschedule
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit overdue\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-reschedule\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List open tasks whose due date has passed, or move them all with \-\-reschedule
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-reschedule\fR [\fI<PHRASE>\fR]
Move every overdue task to this phrase (default `today`), instead of listing them
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit overdue
  orbit overdue \-\-all
  orbit overdue \-\-reschedule
  orbit overdue \-\-reschedule "next monday" \-\-dry\-run
  orbit \-\-json overdue
